extends layout
block content
  p Explore the world's countries, capitals, currencies, populations, and regions.

  p <b>Click the buttons above or input the routes from below</b>
  p /home - Welcome page
  p /countries - Returns a list of all countries in the world, their capitals, and their currency names and symbols.
  p /populous - Returns a list of all countries with at least 50 million population.
  p /regions - Returns the number of countries and the names of each country in each region of the world.
